Windows Virtual Machine Installation

Download Windows 10 Enterprise Evaluation:
https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/evalcenter/download-windows-10-enterprise

Install Git (required for cloning repositories):
https://git-scm.com/

Course Repository (clone after installing Git):
https://github.com/MalwareCube/SOC101_Free

Windows Lab Configuration (For Controlled Lab Use Only)

Disable Real-Time Monitoring:

Set-MpPreference -DisableRealtimeMonitoring $true

Disable Network File Scanning:

Set-MpPreference -DisableScanningNetworkFiles $true

Disable First-Seen Blocking:

Set-MpPreference -DisableBlockAtFirstSeen $true

Disable Windows Defender AntiSpyware:

reg add "HKLM\SOFTWARE\Policies\Microsoft\Windows Defender" /v DisableAntiSpyware /t REG_DWORD /d 1 /f

Clone the course repository:

git clone https://github.com/MalwareCube/SOC101_Free.git
Ubuntu Virtual Machine Installation

Download Latest Ubuntu Desktop:
https://ubuntu.com/download/desktop

Download Previous Ubuntu Versions:
https://releases.ubuntu.com/

Ubuntu System Preparation

Update system packages:

sudo apt update

Install required dependencies:

sudo apt install bzip2 tar gcc make perl git

Install generic kernel headers:

sudo apt install linux-headers-generic

Install system-specific kernel headers:

sudo apt install linux-headers-$(uname -r)

Ensure Git is installed:

sudo apt install git

Clone the repository:

git clone https://github.com/MalwareCube/SOC101_Free.git

Make installation script executable:

chmod +x ./install.sh

Run the installation script:

./install.sh
